OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GSaturday:FA crisp start to the         
OL,8,Fweekend, with long sunny spells        
OL,9,Fthrough the day. Skies turn cloudier   
OL,10,Fin the southwest with rain later and   
OL,11,Fstrong winds developing towards the    
OL,12,Fcoast overnight.                       
OL,14,GOutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRain    
OL,15,Fpersists across the southwest with     
OL,16,Fstrong winds on Sunday, drier          
OL,17,Felsewhere with sunny spells. Frosty    
OL,18,Fovernight. Winds ease Monday, before   
OL,19,Fstrengthening again as rain arrives    
OL,20,Ffrom the west Tuesday.                 
OL,23,D]C        From the Met Office          
