OL,1,Wj#3kj#3kj#3kT]SS | |h<$x,th4(|$| |     
OL,2,Wj $kj $kj 'kT]SS #jw1#ju0 #     
OL,3,W"###"###"###T////,/,-,.,/,-,.,/,/,/////
OL,4,CMassive hope for pancreatic cancer     
OL,5,Cpill after trial saw tumours vanish    
OL,6,GExperts are calling it the biggest     
OL,7,Gbreakthrough in pancreatic cancer      
OL,8,Gtreatment for decades - a daily pill   
OL,9,Gthat appears to shrink and possibly    
OL,10,Geven eliminate tumours in some         
OL,11,Gpatients with one of the deadliest and 
OL,12,Ghardest-to-treat cancers.              
OL,14,FCancer became undetectable on scans in 
OL,15,Fone in 12 of the patients given        
OL,16,Fdaraxonrasib along with chemotherapy   
OL,17,Fin early medical trials.               
